*>================================================================
*> PROGRAM:  lob_stop_trailing.cbl
*> PURPOSE:  Trailing Stop-Loss Dynamic Ratchet Manager
*> ================================================================
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. LOB-STOP-TRAILING.

 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
 SPECIAL-NAMES.
     DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.

 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY "TRAILING-STOP.cpy".
 01  LS-MARKET-TICK-PRICE   PIC S9(09)V9(04) COMP-3.

 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING TRAILING-STOP-STATE, LS-MARKET-TICK-PRICE.
 0000-MAIN.
     IF LS-MARKET-TICK-PRICE > TS-PEAK-HIGH-PRICE
         MOVE LS-MARKET-TICK-PRICE TO TS-PEAK-HIGH-PRICE
         COMPUTE TS-STOP-TRIGGER-PRICE = TS-PEAK-HIGH-PRICE - TS-TRAIL-DELTA-AMOUNT
     ELSE
         IF LS-MARKET-TICK-PRICE <= TS-STOP-TRIGGER-PRICE
             MOVE 'Y' TO TS-TRIGGERED-FLAG
         END-IF
     END-IF
     GOBACK.
